      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "1. JSON Osquery → CMIR → EC2 & EBS",
      "items": [
        "CPU i7-1255U (10C/16T) + 15.35 GiB RAM → aws_instance c6i.2xlarge (o t3.xlarge right-sized)",
        "Disco físico /dev/nvme0n1 (476.94 GiB, 39.04 GiB usados en /) → aws_ebs_volume gp3",
        "Separación estricta entre disco padre nvme0n1 y particiones p1, p2, p3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "2. Red y Puertos → VPC & Security Group",
      "items": [
        "Interfaz wlan0 (10.78.51.148/24) + GW 10.78.51.85 → aws_vpc + aws_subnet privada",
        "listening_ports (sshd :22, ollama :11434, avahi :5353) → reglas ingress en aws_security_group",
        "Puente docker0 (172.17.0.1/16) documentado para cargas de contenedores"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "3. Estrategia Replatform vs. Rehost",
      "items": [
        "Modo Replatform: genera aws_db_instance (PostgreSQL) y aws_mq_broker (RabbitMQ)",
        "Modo Rehost: conserva todos los servicios dentro de aws_instance + aws_ebs_volume",
        "Exportable a provider.tf, variables.tf, main.tf y outputs.tf en 1 clic"
      ]
    }
  ]
